  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Alpha, Bravo, stay back and monitor them carefully. Charlie, wrap around and flank them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "Mercenaries, huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "Whoever trained them must've been rather skilled. Not bad, but also not good enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "Th-this old man is strong!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "You're no match for him. Stand by for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(This woman... won't be simple to deal with.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(These bodyguards won't be able to harm me, but she poses a threat.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Foolish outsiders..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(She's angry now.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(Perhaps from her perspective, she really believes that we deceived Miss Ceylon.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(But, something's not right. Just who is she...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "You must be a pretty experienced mercenary, staying disciplined even though your Mistress is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "Cut the crap! Since you know that our boss was... Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Shut up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(Hmm...? Wait... A crossbow, Feline, and that name...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(Where have I heard that name before...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "Wait, what is this geezer doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(I'm a bit worried about how the Doctor is doing.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "(...But the Doctor is capable enough, as are the others. There shouldn't be any issue.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "Is he senile or something? He's charging straight at us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "Hurry, stop him!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "You'll have to be faster than that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
